\title{Constructions and examples: an index}
\date{2026-10-30}

\p{Operator products, support gradings, finite-state expectations and
symmetry counterexamples connect the definitions to concrete fields.
Each construction below is included with its prerequisites in
[discrete structures and induced physics](fdip-0001).
The [chapter index](fdip-003Z) gives the full reading order.}

